{
  "episode": 30,
  "source": "assets/video/ep30.mp4",
  "model": "base",
  "duration": 307.01425,
  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 30, The Frying Pan."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "Wukong and his companions were tied up in a room in the abbey."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 21.0,
      "text": "I will deal with you all in the morning."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "Said the great immortal. He turned around and left the room."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 32.0,
      "text": "The Tang Monk began to cry."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 32.0,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "It's bad enough that there are dangers along the journey."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 37.0,
      "text": "He said."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "But my own companions are causing trouble for me."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "Come down, Master."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong. We'll get out of this."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "Master, this is all Wukong's fault."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "Said Bajay."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 57.0,
      "text": "He stole the Jin-Sing fruit and he knocked down the tree."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 57.0,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Stealing the fruit was your idea."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 59.0,
      "end": 61.0,
      "text": "Shattered the monkey."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 63.0,
      "text": "I can't help it if I was hungry."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 65.0,
      "text": "Said Bajay."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "You should have refused to steal it."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 71.0,
      "text": "Let's stop arguing and figure out how to escape."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 71.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "Said Wu-Jing."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 75.0,
      "text": "I have a plan."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 76.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 76.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "But we must wait until the great immortal is asleep."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "Late that night, Wukong recited a spell."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "text": "He shrank to the size of a pea and then slipped out from his ropes."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "He quickly untied his friends."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 97.0,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 97.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "He whispered."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "The group tipped toed through the dark and silent abbey."
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 109.0,
      "text": "When they got outside, the sun was beginning to rise."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 109.0,
      "end": 111.0,
      "text": "That was easy."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "They were all in danger as they walked down the road."
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "I hope you all learned a lesson from this."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "Said the Tang monk."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 121.0,
      "text": "Suddenly a voice boomed."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 125.0,
      "text": "You can't escape from me."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 128.0,
      "text": "The great immortal flew toward them."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 132.0,
      "text": "Wukong pulled out his iron bar and swung."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "The great immortal moved out of the way."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 140.0,
      "text": "Bajay struck with his rake and Wu-Jing stabbed with his spear."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 140.0,
      "end": 143.0,
      "text": "The great immortal was fast."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 143.0,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "He waved his arm and his sleeve shut toward the group."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 151.0,
      "text": "Once again, the travelers were swept away."
    }
  ]
}
